  "body": "## What changed\n\n- The 17 tracked `.pyc` blobs under `site/tests/__pycache__/` and `site/tools/__pycache__/` leave the index. My laser stack icons commit (`1d174e09c`) added them.\n- `.gitignore` ignores `__pycache__/` and `*.pyc` in the whole tree.\n- `docs/decisions/4386-pycache-ignore.md` records the choice (a rule for the whole tree, not only `site/`).\n\nNo code, test or asset changes.\n\n## Readings\n\n- `git ls-files | grep __pycache__` on the branch: no output.\n- `python3 -m unittest discover -s site/tests -p \"test_guide_icons.py\"` writes `site/tests/__pycache__/`. `git status --short` stays empty after the run.\n- That suite has 2 failures and 1 error. They are not from this PR, and main has them too:\n  - `op-rotary-contour.png` and `op-rotary-parallel.png` in `site/static/icons/` differ from `assets/ui/`;\n  - `zola` is not installed on this machine.\n\n## Effect on other PRs\n\n#4288 has the same blobs as main after its refresh. When this PR merges first, a later merge of main into #4288 deletes them without a conflict.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No gate: the diff changes only `.gitignore`, binary blobs and a decision file.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #4386\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
